### Ran Playwright code
```js
// Screenshot viewport and save it as screenshots/current.jpg
await page.screenshot({
  path: 'screenshots/current.jpg',
  quality: 90,
  scale: 'css',
  type: 'jpeg'
});
```

### Result
{"turn":"YOUR TURN","round":"2","log":"Round 2 begins. Your company regains its actions.\nGuardian closes in from the ruins.\nArcanist closes in from the ruins.\nRanger closes in from the ruins.\nVanguard closes in from the ruins.","errors":"turn-pill"}
### Ran Playwright code
```js
await (async (page) => { await page.locator('#endTurn').click(); await page.waitForTimeout(6000); return {turn:await page.locator('#turnText').innerText(), round:await page.locator('#roundNo').innerText(), log:await page.locator('#logList').innerText(), errors:await page.locator('#turnPill').getAttribute('class')}; })(page);
```
